 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted (marked (s)): WYS/TPCBALR (Watch Your Step / This Place Can Be A Little Rough), Tatooine, Tatooine Docking Bay, Tatooine Cantina, Squadron Assignments, Insurrection and Staging Areas; Heading For The Medical Frigate (listed under Interrupts, unmarked) is the starting interrupt that pulls the three effects. All count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Docking Bay' (the <> docking bay pulled turn 1 where freighter pilots deploy cheap) dested Spaceport Docking Bay; Coruscant: Docking Bay was not yet released and is a Dark page.",
  "Posted 'Barrier' in a Light deck dested Rebel Barrier; 'Nekkid 3PO' dested Threepio With His Parts Showing; 'ECC Lando' dested Lando With Blaster Pistol; 'Jedi Luke' dested Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight; 'Falcon' dested Millennium Falcon; 'Luke's Saber' dested Luke's Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine' and 'Tatooine Cantina' dested the Light Premiere printings.",
  "The line 'Gay podracer' is the poster's section header above Anakin's Podracer, not a card; removed. Total 60.",
